        {
          "text": "Amulyango wakasensa, Salumu mwana wa-Koli-hoze, mweendelezi wacipanzi ca-Mizipa, nguwakaumamika, Wakauyaka, wauvumba, waimika zitendele zyawo azijaluzyo zyawo aminkulu yawo, alimwi wakayaka bulambo bwaziba lya-Siloamu libambene amuunda wamwami, mane kusikila kumatantilo aaseluka kuya kumunzi wa-Davida, ",
