        {
          "text": "Kusule lyayooyo, Nehemiya mwana wa-Azibuki, mweendelezi wacipanzi ca-Beti-zuri, wakamamika mane kusikila antu aalangene amavwika aa-Davida, akusikila kuziba ilyakacitwa, kuŋanda yabasilumamba. ",
