        {
          "text": "Kusule lyayooyo ba-Levi bakamamika: Rehumu mwana wa-Bani; kubbazu lyakwe Hasabiya, mweendelezi wacipanzi ca-Keila, wakamamika mucipanzi cakwe. ",
