        {
          "text": "Kusule lyakwe Meremoti mwana wa-Uriya mwana wa-Hakozi wakamamika caabilo cabili kuzwa kumulyango waŋanda ya-Eliyasibu kusikila kumamanino aaŋanda ya-Eliyasibu. ",
